{"artifactPath":".agents/evidence-integrity.md","content":"## 3. Transport proof

Artifact delivery, Project Source upload, thread upload, CDP send, or route-gated push are transport facts. They need transport proof:

- what was sent;
- exact instruction or payload ref;
- where it was sent;
- who sent it;
- when it was sent;
- readback result;
- hash or stable identifier when available.
